<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Municipal Electric Authority, Ga..</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Municipal Electric Authority, Ga..</headline>
<text>
<p>MUNICIPAL ELECTRIC AUTHORITY OF GEORGIA</p>
<p>RE: $397,750,000</p>
<p>PROJECT ONE SUBORDINATED BONDS, SERIES 1997A</p>
<p>PROJECT ONE SUBORDINATED BONDS, SERIES 1997B</p>
<p>GENERAL RESOLUTION PROJECTS SUBORDINATED BONDS,</p>
<p>SERIES 1997A</p>
<p>Effective at 9:15 A.M. E.D.T., Friday, July 18, 1997</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>The Robinson-Humphrey Company, Inc.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
